    "change": "Kotoba became too fast for the earlier fixed iteration count: in the previous attempt (m87) matmult-int timed 0.120 s, under the 0.5 s floor, and the suite aborted. The revision runs each Kotoba workload m_w times as many iterations and divides by m_w; everything else is unchanged.",
